factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article gives no reason for the power cut; the reel_script states it is for maintenance work (பராமரிப்புப் பணிகளுக்காக), which is an invented cause.
  The article does not say the outage is 'in the Madukkarai substation area' as a general area; the reel_script and caption extend the scope beyond the listed localities, which is an unsupported claim, and the phrase 'மின்விநியோகம் இருக்காது' (no supply) is not stated in the article.
  The reel_script advises residents to prepare in advance, and the caption adds 'மின் தடைக்கு முன் தேவையானவற்றை தயார் செய்யுங்கள்'; this advice is not in the article.
  The caption's English line 'Madukkarai power cut on 30 Nov 10 AM-3 PM | Coimbatore news' is a claim not in the article's Tamil text, though it restates the same facts.
